{"ref":"character:ashtart","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Malice_Bloodmoon.gif","w":40,"h":44}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Legacy of the Bloodmoon)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Ashtart is a playable character from the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Incineration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:incineration"}," ",{"t":"Incineration","r":"weapon:incineration"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 August 2026 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["ASHTART"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterController_Ashtart"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Incineration.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:incineration"}," ",{"t":"Incineration","r":"weapon:incineration"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the ",{"t":"Ashella","r":"weapon:ashella"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Coffin","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Borrowed_Feathers.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Borrowed Feathers\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["-20%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-10%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+8"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Ashtart can be unlocked by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ashella.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ashella"}," ",{"t":"Ashella","r":"weapon:ashella"},". She then must be purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Ashtart can be unlocked in ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"gonehollow\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Ashtart starts with -20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", -10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", +50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}," and +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Ashtart will gain +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"}," upon falling to CriticalHP."]},{"k":"p","c":["As the start of every minute (X:00), Ashtart will summon skeletons depending on how many enemies were defeated in that minute. Defeating an enemy has a 25% chance, multiplied by ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},", to add 1 skeleton to the next batch summoned. When summoned, Ashtart's skeletons are invulnerable for 0.3 seconds and seek out enemies, exploding upon collision and insta-killing nearby enemies. If an enemy hit has insta-kill immunity, they will instead be dealt damage directly. A maximum of 200 skeletons can be on-screen at a time. Skeletons will return to Ashtart if no enemies are able to be targeted."]},{"k":"p","c":["Ashtart is immune to Health Drain effects."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Increasing both ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"}," can drastically increase how many skeletons Ashtart summons each minute, as more enemies will spawn while being more likely to increase the number of skeletons spawned."]},{"c":["Ashtart works well with the ",{"i":"Sprite-Velvet_Dodecahedron.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:velvet-dodecahedron"}," ",{"t":"Velvet Dodecahedron","r":"passive:velvet-dodecahedron"},", as it allows her to gain up to +6 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"}," simply from levelling it up. In addition, the lowered health is less of an issue for her than usual thanks to all the Revivals she can generate and her skeletons distracting enemies."]},{"c":["If building around Revival, Ashtart can make great use of ",{"i":"Sprite-Phieraggi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Meal_Ticket.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"t":"Meal Ticket","r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sarabande_of_Healing_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ensures that Ashtart's HP-critical ability recharges immediately upon revival, making her effectively immortal against anything that can't deal more than 20% of her max HP. If she also has the ",{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," arcana, she can infinitely scale her stats for as long as enemies are able to kill her."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Ashtart.png","w":113,"h":120,"c":["Ashtart's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Ashtart.gif","w":110,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Ashtart_-_LotB_trailer.png","w":176,"h":150,"c":["Ashtart as seen in the ",{"t":"announcement trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hzs7c8XppPw"}," of Legacy of the Bloodmoon."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 August 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}